A compact summary of the transcript’s recurring mechanisms is $\begin{aligned}
\hbox{wealth building}
&\approx
\hbox{discipline}
+\hbox{ownership}
+\hbox{asymmetry}
+\hbox{trust} \notag\\
&\quad
+\hbox{relationships}
+\hbox{research}
+\hbox{margin control}
+\hbox{judgment}.\end{aligned}$ This is not a formula that computes net worth. It is a sorting device. The interviews begin with visible outcomes, but the useful work begins when we ask what kind of number we are hearing, what risk produced it, what operating behavior sustained it, what relationships made it possible, and what cautions keep the story source-conscious.

